    titleEn: "EVs and Hybrids in Egypt: What Charging and Running Costs Really Look Like",
    titleAr: "السيارات الكهربائية والهجينة في مصر: التكلفة الحقيقية للشحن والتشغيل",
    excerptEn:
      "Charging prices, fuel prices and import duties changed fast in 2026. Here is the honest per-kilometre maths for EVs, hybrids and petrol cars in Egypt, as of November 2026.",
